      ],
      "title": "asterix: Const-ify and fix an UB.",
      "message": "asterix: Const-ify and fix an UB.\n\nMove 17 kBytes of data from a read-write section to a read-only section.\n\nWhile we're here, fix a complaint from UBSAN about a left-shift of signed\ninteger 1 by 31 places by making it unsigned, and also replace some \"sizeof arr\n/ sizeof arr[0]\" with \"array_length(arr)\", and avoid making unnecessary copies\nof some array elements which are only ever read.\n",
      "author_name": "Darius Davis",
      "author_email": "darius-wireshark@free-range.com.au",
      "authored_date": "2025-10-09T17:39:31.000+10:00",
